0 L-01 ILLEGAL: a System side-stud pushed into a Technic hole.
0 The 1x1 brick's side stud enters the Technic brick's bore, so the two bricks
0 are asked to sit flush. They do not: the side-stud face and the bore are
0 offset by about 0.30 LDU in real plastic. LDraw does not model that error, so
0 this renders as if it fitted -- which is exactly why the rule has to be
0 stated rather than seen.
0 Name: L-01.illegal.ldr
0 Author: ldraw-verify CANON
